  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.5.1 introduces HeroParser.Console (a zero-allocation, reflection-free, 100% Native AOT compatible terminal widget library replacing Spectre.Console) and the heroparser CLI tool for validating, profiling, converting, and translating datasets with full LLM and WinGet integration. Full changelog: https://github.com/KoalaFacts/HeroParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
